  "name": "Gulf of Alaska 14 KM Analyzed SST Fields",
  "description": "This data set contains SST field temperatures at 14 km resolution for the Gulf of Alaska. The Office of Satellite Data Processing and Distribution (OSDPC) keeps this data for a month, then sends it to the National Climatic Data Center (NCDC) for archiving. For current data, contact John Sapper at OSDPC, telephone 301-457-0914 ext.148, e-mail: john.sapper@noaa.gov. For archived data contact Thomas Ross at NCDC, telephone 828-271-4499, e-mail: tom.ross@noaa.gov.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To archive SST field temperature data.",
